Check.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:07.660
The Cosmic Fracture is certainly stirring things up, isn't it?

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.710
The discord between the Foundations going away is a good thing.

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:16.070
Perhaps humans cannot be united unless there is a foreign enemy.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:17.660
Check.

00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.090
That is most depressing.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:21.940
Checkmate.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.360
Humanity will grow more spiritual.

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:29.630
I want to believe that.

